{"severity":"error","file":"errors/no_panic_violation_4.march","start_line":5,"start_col":23,"end_line":5,"end_col":28,"message":"`check` in `mod Safe` (declared `cap no_panic`) calls `panic`, which can panic.\n`validate`, `validate_all` in this module reach it too.\n\nReturn an error value (`Result`, `Option`) instead of calling `panic`.","code":"no_panic_violation","fix":null,"labels":[{"file":"errors/no_panic_violation_4.march","start_line":9,"start_col":4,"end_line":9,"end_col":9,"message":"`validate` reaches it through `check` here"},{"file":"errors/no_panic_violation_4.march","start_line":13,"start_col":4,"end_line":13,"end_col":12,"message":"`validate_all` reaches it through `validate` here"}],"notes":[]}
